  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The arrow lodges in your elbow, severing the head of one of the long bones of the forearm and jamming the delicate elbow joint at a very painful 90-degree angle!</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (3) from the blinding pain. Also, suffer a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.rlDZZTj5PXjuRXa2]{Broken Bone (Major)}, except it cannot begin to heal until the arrow is Extracted.</p><p><strong>Surgery (Hard)</strong> will be required to Extract the arrowhead and somewhat realign the bones of the elbow.</p>"
    },
